== term_of_parsed_term, second-order variables
lam{x. 'x<|H|>} (bound, no arguments)        Tmp!lam{'x. 'x}
f{'a<|H|>[c]}                                Tmp!f{'a<|H|>[Tmp!c]}
f{'a<|!!|>[c]}                               Tmp!f{'a<||>[Tmp!c]}
f{'a<|H|>['b<|!!|>]}                         Tmp!f{'a<|H|>['b<||>]}
<J>; x: 'A<|!!|> >- C (a hypothesis converted) Arg: Tmp!arg Hyps:       1.<J<||>>       2.x :'A<|J|> Goal:Tmp!C
<J>; x: A; y: 'B<|!!|> >- C (x kept, y converted) Arg: Tmp!arg Hyps:       1.<J<||>>       2.x :Tmp!A       3.y :'B<|J|> Goal:Tmp!C
f{z} (a free variable)                       Tmp!f{'z<||>}
== term_of_parsed_term_with_vars
f{'a<|!!|>}                                  Tmp!f{'a<||>}
f{z} (a free variable)                       Tmp!f{'z}
<J> >- 'C<|!!|>                              Arg: Tmp!arg Hyps:       1.<J<||>> Goal:'C<|J|>
== display_term_of_term
