<J> >- 'C<|K|> (others)                      Arg: Tmp!arg Hyps:       1.Base_dform!df_context{'J<|!!|>} Goal:'C<|K|>
<J> >- 'C<||>                                Arg: Tmp!arg Hyps:       1.Base_dform!df_context{'J<|!!|>} Goal:'C<||>
